libdrizzle
------------------------------------------
Client and protocol library for the Drizzle database

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libdrizzle-devel-5.1.4-1bl2
  libdrizzle9-5.1.4-1bl2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://launchpad.net/libdrizzle

Canonical download:
  https://launchpad.net/libdrizzle/5.1/5.1.4/+download/libdrizzle-5.1.4.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libdrizzle-5.1.4-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libdrizzle-5.1.4-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libdrizzle-5.1.4-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdrizzle-5.1.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdrizzle9-5.1.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdrizzle-devel-5.1.4-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

